# UE5 gitignore (generated for AFTERFALL, UE 5.8, Windows client+server)
# Compiled binaries
Binaries/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
# Build artifacts
Build/
# VS artifacts
.vs/
*.VC.db
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.suo
*.xcodeproj
*.xcworkspace
# Rider
.idea/
# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
# Packaging
*.pdb
*.ipdb
# Duplicate Epic-template project (source only, 134M). Canonical project is root Afterfall.uproject.
# Template art merged to root Content/FirstPerson, Input, LevelPrototyping + Config/DefaultInput.ini.
/AfterFall/
# Keep project files
!*.uproject
!*.uplugin
!Source/**/*.cpp
!Source/**/*.h
!Source/**/*.cs
!Config/**/*.ini
!Content/**/*.uasset
!*.sh
